  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "关于宝可梦的属性，\n我得出了一个结论。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51734E8E5B9D53EF68A676845C5E6027FF0C000A62115F9751FA4E864E004E2A7ED38BBA300200100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那就是一般属性才是最强的！！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A35C31662F4E00822C5C5E6027624D662F67005F3A7684FF01FF0100100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一般属性几乎没有\n不擅长对付的属性。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E00822C5C5E602751E04E4E6CA16709000A4E0D64C5957F5BF94ED876845C5E6027300200100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也就是说一般属性是能\n对付任何对手的万能选手。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F5C31662F8BF44E00822C5C5E6027662F80FD000A5BF94ED84EFB4F555BF9624B76844E0780FD9009624B300200100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我游历过各个地区，\n跟各种宝可梦对战过，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n所以我说的肯定不会有错。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62116E3853868FC754044E2A5730533AFF0C000A8DDF540479CD5B9D53EF68A65BF962188FC7FF0C00100001BE00000A62404EE562118BF4768480AF5B9A4E0D4F1A67099519300200100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要不我就跟你打一场对战，\n来证明一般属性最强论是对的吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89814E0D62115C318DDF4F6062534E00573A5BF96218FF0C000A67658BC1660E4E00822C5C5E602767005F3A8BBA662F5BF976845427FF0100100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是你准备好了，\n能来跟我说一声吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F4F6051C65907597D4E86FF0C000A80FD67658DDF62118BF44E0058F05417FF1F00100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我要证明一般属性最强论是对的。\n你准备好了吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621189818BC1660E4E00822C5C5E602767005F3A8BBA662F5BF976843002000A4F6051C65907597D4E865417FF1F00100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "准备好了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51C65907597D4E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还没有",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD86CA167090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你就好好准备吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F605C31597D597D51C659075427300200100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的宝可梦全都是一般属性！\n面对任何对手应该都能获胜。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621176845B9D53EF68A6516890FD662F4E00822C5C5E6027FF01000A97625BF94EFB4F555BF9624B5E948BE590FD80FD83B780DC300200100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "果然还是得追求\n更有利的属性才行吗……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "679C71368FD8662F5F978FFD6C42000A66F46709522976845C5E6027624D884C54172026202600100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但其实……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4651765B9E2026202600100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我根本记不住属性的相克关系！\n因为组合太多了，对吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62116839672C8BB04E0D4F4F5C5E6027768476F8514B51737CFBFF01000A56E04E3A7EC45408592A591A4E86FF0C5BF95427FF0100100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我问你呀！你能清楚记住\n属性的相克关系吗！？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621195EE4F605440FF014F6080FD6E05695A8BB04F4F000A5C5E6027768476F8514B51737CFB5417FF01FF1F00100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一清二楚",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E006E054E8C695A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我没自信",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62116CA181EA4FE10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你真是个厉害的训练家！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60771F662F4E2A53895BB376848BAD7EC35BB6FF0100100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看来大家都是半斤八两。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B676559275BB690FD662F534A65A4516B4E24300200100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我只要始终如一地使用一般属性就好！\n即使它不是最强的，也应该是万能的！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621153EA898159CB7EC859824E0057304F7F75284E00822C5C5E60275C31597DFF01000A53734F7F5B834E0D662F67005F3A7684FF0C4E5F5E948BE5662F4E0780FD7684FF0100100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但是有一种属性，\n一般属性的招式对它完全没有效……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n那就是幽灵属性！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46662F67094E0079CD5C5E6027FF0C000A4E00822C5C5E6027768462DB5F0F5BF95B835B8C51686CA1670965482026202600100001BE00000A90A35C31662F5E7D70755C5E6027FF0100100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是一般属性的招式\n对幽灵属性有效的话……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n那就能对付任何对手了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F4E00822C5C5E6027768462DB5F0F000A5BF95E7D70755C5E60276709654876848BDD2026202600100001BE00000A90A35C3180FD5BF94ED84EFB4F555BF9624B4E86FF0100100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001A>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是一般属性的招式\n对幽灵属性有效的话……！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
